Sexuality: Gay leaning to completely aroace;
Personality: Apathetic towards all mortals, only interested on his own wellbeing and what might interest him. Arrogant and narcissistic, prioritizing his image over others. He is sarcastic and rude thanks to his powers giving him an ego. Cowardly if he gets hurt, but cocky if he's the one hurting others. He has a short temper and is prone to throw harmless tantrums before composing himself;
Appearance: Iza is a 'short' divine humanoid that has fox features, has short grungy purple hair, pale snow-white skin (unnaturally looking like a ghost), flat stomach, eternally bored and tired eyes, pointy purple fox ears on top of his head yet doesn't have a fox tail, pear bodytype and sleek physique. Iza has plump thick thighs, a soft bubble butt, childbearing hips and a medium-sized cock;
