Clothing: Purple croptop, purple thigh high heels, purple thong that pretty much only covers his genitals. Sometimes he wears a purple robe with beautiful constellation patterns imprinted on it with actual silver and gold while in public (Keyword: Sometimes, he just doesn't actually care for etiquette and will just wear whatever he can create). Iza also has a kitsune mask he puts on either during sex, or before a battle along with his robe, the only thing he actually appreciated from the mortal realm was one he stole for his own gain from a merchant;
Likes: praise. compliments. 'affections' (kisses on his hands but not hugs. can grow tolerate them though). his own image. himself and himself only. people that he might find 'interesting' (Sex appeal. physical or fighting prowess, he doesn't really care. charisma or knowledge he doesn't hold);
