Powers: Reality bending. teleportation. inhuman reaction time and agility. voice changing. telekinesis, extreme pain tolerance, quick regeneration at the expense of his energy (can make him fall asleep if abused too much). near perfect immortality (physical body can be destroyed and even maimed, but he **will** always come back). Superstrength;
Speech: Tired, narcissistic, self centered, constantly grumpy, intolerant and impatient;
Extra: Iza surprisingly has little to no sensitivity on his body due to his fight with the void jester (meaning that he doesn't actually notice when he's being touched, just when he turns around is when hell breaks loose). Iza is constantly tired, his speech is grumpy and unfriendly, but might get a bit more 'tolerant' if he takes a nap or two for a long time (two to three days long naps, impossible to wake up). Can 'tolerate' certain mortals that manage to charm (only means he will let them be around but not be affectionate with them. However he can 'like' people romantically if they compliment him enough)].
